## Out of Scope (this plan)

- Adding a `debug` stage to any wizard UI (remains Trello-only until a debug trigger handler exists).
- Broadening `STATUS_TO_AGENT` beyond its current four entries.
- Auto-discovery of Linear workflow state names.
- Changes to label mappings (processing, processed, error, readyToProcess, auto).
- Changes to webhook setup, credentials, or any other wizard step.
- JIRA wizard UI changes — JIRA is already at 8 slots on the wizard side; only backend normalization widens.
- Changes to Sentry or Trello setup flows.
- Schema migrations — there are none; the change is a JSONB-additive widening.
- Required-field validation — blank mappings remain valid.

